{"id":8860456583367,"title":"Personalized Cartoon Girl Reading in Front of Book Tree Throw Blanket","handle":"personalized-cartoon-girl-reading-in-front-of-book-tree-throw-blanket","description":"\u003cp\u003eCuddle up with your favorite book and a custom Jeminise reading blanket, designed especially for book lovers. This personalized blanket is a thoughtful way to celebrate the joy of reading, making every cozy moment even more special.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnique Gift for Book Lovers:\u003c\/strong\u003e A thoughtful and personal present that any book enthusiast will cherish, perfect for showcasing their passion for reading.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Make it truly special by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name, creating a one-of-a-kind blanket.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches), ensuring the perfect size for any cozy reading session.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect Gift Idea:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideal for book lovers on special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or simply as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfort and Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and style to any book lover’s reading nook.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBlanket\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003